<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Beyond Over-Refusal: Scenario-Based Diagnostics and Post-Hoc Mitigation for Exaggerated Refusals in LLMs</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
